&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Resignation<b Style='font-size:20px;'> \u2610</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Expansion<b  Style='font-size:20px;'> \u2610</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Workload<b Style='font-size:20px;'> \u2610</b><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Quantity Policy<b  Style='font-size:20px;'> \u2610</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Termination<b  Style='font-size:20px;'> \u2611</b>\n    {% endif %}\n    </tr>\n</table>\n<table border = '1' width= 100%>\n    <tr style = 'border-top-style:hidden'> \n        <td colspan = '8' style ='text-align:left;font-size:20px;'>Proposed Designation&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>{{doc.proposed_designation or ''}}</b></td>\n    </tr>\n     <tr style = 'border-top-style:hidden' > \n<td colspan=\"8\" style=\"text-align:justify; font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"text-align:left;\"> Job Description</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>{{ doc.job_description or '' }}</b>\n</td>    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<table border=\"1\" width=\"100%\">\n    <tr>\n       <td  >\n            <table border=\"1\" width=\"100%\">\n                <tr>\n                    <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:17px;border-top-style:hidden;border-bottom-style:hidden;border-left-style:hidden;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n                    <td colspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:20px;border:2px black solid;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n                    <td colspan=\"6\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:17px;border-top-style:hidden;border-bottom-style:hidden;\"></td>\n                    <td colspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:20px;border:2px black solid;\"></td>\n                    <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;border-top-style:hidden;border-bottom-style:hidden;border-right-style:hidden;font-size:17px;\"></td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                     <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:17px;border-top-style:hidden;border-bottom-style:hidden;border-left-style:hidden;\"></td>\n                    <td colspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:20px;border-bottom-style:hidden;border-left-style:hidden;border-right-style:hidden;\">Identified by (HOD)</td>\n                    <td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:20px;border-top-style:hidden;border-bottom-style:hidden;\"></td>\n\n                    <td colspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:20px;border-bottom-style:hidden;border-left-style:hidden;border-right-style:hidden;\"></td>\n                    <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom-style:hidden;border-right-style:hidden;font-size:20px;\">Recommended by (COO)</td>\n                </tr>\n                \n            </table>\n    </table>\n <table border = '1' width= 100%>\n    <tr style = 'border-top-style:hidden'>  \n        <td colspan = '8' style ='text-align:center;font-size:25px;'><b>(FOR HRD USE ONLY)</b></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr border = '2px' style ='text-align:center;'>  \n    \n        <td colspan = '1' style ='text-align:center;font-size:20px;border:1px black solid;'><b>Grade &nbsp;</b></td>\n        <td colspan = '3' style ='text-align:center;font-size:20px;border:1px black solid;'>{{doc.grade or ''}}&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;     </td>\n        <td colspan = '1' style ='text-align:center;font-size:20px;border:1px black solid;'><b>Salary</b></td>\n        <td colspan = '3' style ='text-align:center;font-size:20px;border:1px black solid;'>{{doc.salary or ''}}&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;    </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr border = '2px' style ='text-align:center;'>  \n    \n        <td colspan = '1' style ='text-align:center;font-size:20px;border:1px black solid;'><b>HRD&nbsp;</b></td>\n        <td colspan = '3' style ='text-align:center;font-size:20px;border:1px black solid;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n        <td colspan = '1' style ='text-align:center;font-size:20px;border:1px black solid;'><b>MD'S Approval</b></td>\n        <td colspan = '3' style ='text-align:center;font-size:20px;border:1px black solid;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n<p style ='text-align:left;font-size:20px;'>HRD / 10 / A  &nbsp;&nbsp;  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<i>P T O</i></p>\n<br><br>\n<div class='page'>\n<table border = '1' width= 100%>\n    <tr >  \n        <td colspan = '8' style ='font-size:20px;'><b>OBJECTIVES (MRF) :-</b></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style = 'border-top-style:hidden'>  \n        <td colspan = '8' style ='font-size:20px;'><b>The MRF (Manpower Requisition Form) is designed with multi - purpose Objectives Like:-</b></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style = 'border-top-style:hidden'>  \n        <td colspan = '8' style ='font-size:20px;'>a) MRF is forwarded after looking into other alternatives like internal movement,for promotion, inter-group transfer etc.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style = 'border-top-style:hidden'>  \n        <td colspan = '8' style ='font-size:20px;'>b)To have a proper job description for each vacancy (employee) identified for HR record.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style = 'border-top-style:hidden'>  \n        <td colspan = '8' style ='font-size:20px;'>c) To enable the HR department to reduce the recruitment process time.<br><br></td>\n    </tr>\n    \n    </table>\n    <br><br>\n    <table border = '1'  style=\" width:100%; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\n        \n    <tr >  \n        <td colspan = '8' style ='font-size:20px;'><b><br>RULES /GUIDELINES</b> to follow while filling up the form:-</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style = 'border-top-style:hidden'>  \n        <td colspan = '8' style ='font-size:20px;'><b>\u261e</b>  The Form has to be filled in complete.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style = 'border-top-style:hidden'>  \n        <td colspan = '8' style ='font-size:20px;'>\u261e  Be very specific in terms of job Description.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style = 'border-top-style:hidden'>  \n        <td colspan = '8' style ='font-size:20px;'>\u261e  It is required to fill in individual form for each position.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style = 'border-top-style:hidden'>  \n        <td colspan = '8' style ='font-size:20px;'>\u261e  MRF is to be forwarded to the HR department well in advance, anticipating the time taken for recruitment process which is 15-25 days for junior level and for Middle and Senior level it is 30 days or more.</td>\n    </tr>\n    </table>\n    <br><br>\n    <table border = '1'  style=\" width:100%; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\n    <tr>  \n        <td colspan = '8' style ='font-size:20px;'><b><u>MRF ROUTING :-</u> </b><br></td>\n        \n    </tr>\n\n     <tr style = 'border-top-style:hidden'>  \n        <td colspan = '8'>&nbsp;<img src=\"/private/files/WhatsApp Image 2023-09-29 at 8.47.15 AM.jpeg\" width=100% height=60%>\n</td>    \n     </tr>\n</table>\n</div>",
